      {
        "id": 12907,
        "quiz_id": 2179,
        "type": "writing",
        "title": "Large companies use sports events to promote their products. Some people think it has negative impacts on sports.  To what extent do you agree or disagree?",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-W8x4d9kGno7XAOxNrxgl4ddzgWf\"><em><strong>Large companies use sports events to promote their products. Some people think it has negative impacts on sports. </strong></em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BZm6dwOT9oPNjWx6PKflhqm0gSf\"><em><strong>To what extent do you agree or disagree?</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NTzNd8mj9oUwbFx0MFilTG8bg97\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 2 - Sports and Advertising</em></p>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NTzNd8mj9oUwbFx0MFilTG8bg97\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1. Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LGDQdWiIvohAS0xObhKlh062gjf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XXiXdc8jcoje1fxGxpllOH9Lg9d\">\n<ul>\n<li>Đề b&agrave;i Sports and Advertising&nbsp;n&oacute;i về việc c&aacute;c c&ocirc;ng ty lớn sử dụng c&aacute;c sự kiện thể thao để quảng b&aacute; sản phẩm của họ. Một số người cho rằng điều n&agrave;y c&oacute; t&aacute;c động ti&ecirc;u cực đến thể thao. Đề b&agrave;i Sports and Advertising&nbsp;y&ecirc;u cầu ch&uacute;ng ta b&agrave;y tỏ quan điểm đồng &yacute; hay kh&ocirc;ng đồng &yacute; với &yacute; kiến n&agrave;y.</li>\n<li>Đ&acirc;y l&agrave; một chủ đề phức tạp v&igrave; n&oacute; li&ecirc;n quan đến mối quan hệ giữa kinh doanh v&agrave; thể thao. Một mặt, t&agrave;i trợ từ c&aacute;c c&ocirc;ng ty lớn gi&uacute;p tổ chức được nhiều sự kiện thể thao quy m&ocirc; lớn. Mặt kh&aacute;c, việc quảng c&aacute;o qu&aacute; nhiều c&oacute; thể l&agrave;m mất đi bản chất thuần t&uacute;y của thể thao.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CaaPdALkUoj39UxqBaClSdzHg7g\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2. Gợi &yacute; lập luận &amp; ph&acirc;n BODY&nbsp;</strong></span></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZOO2dHUkAoCdQHxoIXwl6579g8f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PuFQdf8aPoazSgxALC6l1Q8ygdh\">\n<ul>\n<li>Bạn c&oacute; thể đồng &yacute; hoặc kh&ocirc;ng đồng &yacute; với quan điểm trong đề b&agrave;i. Ở đ&acirc;y, ch&uacute;ng ta sẽ chọn quan điểm <strong>\"đồng &yacute; một phần\"</strong> - việc c&aacute;c c&ocirc;ng ty lớn t&agrave;i trợ cho thể thao c&oacute; cả mặt t&iacute;ch cực v&agrave; ti&ecirc;u cực.</li>\n<li><strong>Trong b&agrave;i n&agrave;y ch&uacute;ng ta sẽ lập luận theo c&aacute;ch Partly Agree (đồng &yacute; một phần).</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>BODY 1: N&ecirc;u những t&aacute;c động ti&ecirc;u cực của việc c&aacute;c c&ocirc;ng ty lớn quảng b&aacute; sản phẩm qua c&aacute;c sự kiện thể thao.</li>\n<li>BODY 2: B&agrave;n về những lợi &iacute;ch m&agrave; việc t&agrave;i trợ của c&aacute;c c&ocirc;ng ty lớn mang lại cho thể thao.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O6Q8dKUwJolsRLxRHMKlYAGzgPb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3. Gợi &yacute; viết BODY 1</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ARYZdTorMo8GHUxXiaxlbgKog9K\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B3WzdXi90obr9exqY49ldT5Wg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T3vid37FgouPrLxntpAllbSOgpd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ABpydqwzqoBt8mxtA2clX4h8gmh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FRtld534aoXQ8Cxcdevl45SsgZc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OtESdRTjnoSJwzxYBWkl2MvDgXb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UaoQdMKTxottsFx5xHZl5y6dgTe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ShyKdSzwIoav15xhSR1lkgYvgiN\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DOKFdb3lZooCb8xoeEnlIGeQgTg\">BODY 1 m&igrave;nh sẽ n&ecirc;u những t&aacute;c động ti&ecirc;u cực của việc c&aacute;c c&ocirc;ng ty lớn quảng b&aacute; sản phẩm qua c&aacute;c sự kiện thể thao.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZkrXdlYjQojMZUxzmgNlM6qvgtd\">Cấu tr&uacute;c: Topic Sentence ➜ Supporting Idea 1 ➜ Supporting Idea 2</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Topic sentence:</span></strong>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J2Mgd651jokGr5xFFcTlMHOagYg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YIkYdyyfZoikZgxMfM9ly4SYghh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Mk2zdFhmloeQGbxZgDwlEsvwgnh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-JesqdVbvXoysYjxqtf7lyoDSg7c\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-S0GAd5xJ8oGcMrxuRAElpmNagXe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-O3TbdHHU9o7SqZxJtSGlWRaJgKg\">Mục đ&iacute;ch ch&iacute;nh của c&aacute;c sự kiện thể thao l&agrave; khuyến kh&iacute;ch lối sống năng động (<strong>active lifestyles</strong>) v&agrave; mang lại giải tr&iacute;, nhưng những mục ti&ecirc;u n&agrave;y thường bị ảnh hưởng bởi c&aacute;c quảng c&aacute;o kh&ocirc;ng li&ecirc;n quan đến thể thao (<strong>irrelevant advertisements</strong>), đặc biệt l&agrave; cho c&aacute;c sản phẩm kh&ocirc;ng l&agrave;nh mạnh.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Supporting idea 1:</span></strong>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZSGudTTeHoUUbwxmgwvlnevNg0d\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Br0HdPtt2o6yaDxssU5lFwBbgic\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CXHedb5Q5o0ChTxzjeJlACIHgBe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Qw7XdcQDiopHAmxbaJzlaWDZgjb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EAA1dQKV5otLAmxFGgBlpln2gIe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N5dHdBAjeojWA3xMEbCl8pn1gyB\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-IAbldxsOzoo2wFxmKA9lpeamg5g\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-CJ6GdGRwXoudFAxIHTnlNCa9gPg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-XjzJdlL5zob6olxqy3olBauTgcd\">Quảng c&aacute;o c&aacute;c sản phẩm c&oacute; hại như đồ uống c&oacute; đường hoặc rượu (<strong>sugary or alcoholic drinks</strong>) trong c&aacute;c giải đấu thể thao</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-XjzJdlL5zob6olxqy3olBauTgcd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>➜ truyền tải th&ocirc;ng điệp sai lầm (<strong>convey the wrong message</strong>)&nbsp;cho kh&aacute;n giả</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-XjzJdlL5zob6olxqy3olBauTgcd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>➜ tạo cho họ cảm gi&aacute;c rằng những sản phẩm đ&oacute; c&oacute; mối li&ecirc;n hệ t&iacute;ch cực đến sức khỏe v&agrave; thể h&igrave;nh (<strong>positively associated with health and fitness</strong>)</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Supporting idea 2:</span></strong>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RJW5dfJhqofjuXxEd7dlCvwzg3b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LQSEdv0Y1oIVaoxMMoxljdOvgOd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HNQNdCbCpoystuxVP43luHtDgeb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HJ7FdScShoqf2QxHEgylSbaAgyf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NFfDdmOXNoOWwZxiNtZl15SMgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A0zKdQFrWoIXtex6mhplQSoegxb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-T2mWd1rtBo8T07x6awTlNUNqg9f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-JBCSdVvxnoc32txdp4rlAkA1gib\">Việc vận động vi&ecirc;n bị buộc phải sử dụng c&aacute;c sản phẩm được quảng c&aacute;o trong sự kiện</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-JBCSdVvxnoc32txdp4rlAkA1gib\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>➜ dẫn đến người h&acirc;m mộ (<strong>loyal</strong> <strong>fans</strong>) bắt chước</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-JBCSdVvxnoc32txdp4rlAkA1gib\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>➜ người xem c&oacute; thể mất hứng th&uacute; v&agrave; niềm tin (<strong>lose interest and faith</strong>) v&agrave;o cả m&ocirc;n thể thao v&agrave; c&aacute;c vận động vi&ecirc;n&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-JBCSdVvxnoc32txdp4rlAkA1gib\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>➜ l&agrave;m giảm sự phổ biến của c&aacute;c m&ocirc;n thể thao được t&agrave;i trợ bởi c&aacute;c quảng c&aacute;o g&acirc;y tranh c&atilde;i (<strong>sports with questionable advertising choices</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-JBCSdVvxnoc32txdp4rlAkA1gib\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I85fdLrlqovzpLxkUCfldUM5gEg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4. Gợi &yacute; viết BODY 2</strong> </span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-I85fdLrlqovzpLxkUCfldUM5gEg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FkKtdjQLbo1AtlxkzyalC6VXgEc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AZT8dluWuoiebixsy4zlDBdDg8f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ub8odKVWsohu3TxKHTylRfJ3gqT\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IO0OdZMbkop2KtxaAgbl07P0g3f\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ap4ndJ97bocXozxn7oAl3Txmgte\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FwiNdcUNSoCW0UxEnPxlYn1NgYe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Lsjlde9EKo9cSdxAvmulNTZPgbd\">Trong BODY 2, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ b&agrave;n về những lợi &iacute;ch m&agrave; việc t&agrave;i trợ của c&aacute;c c&ocirc;ng ty lớn mang lại cho thể thao.\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DAmSdaSbsoPfFGxtuWtlqiXAgPc\">Cấu tr&uacute;c: Topic Sentence ➜ Supporting Idea 1 ➜ Supporting Idea 2</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Topic sentence:</span></strong></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-ZakddQ7nJoAgFyxpFvNleucyg4d\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OBDmdoEGDoDyBgxNOqylocGigdc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PoBydy7ixoRrKIxO5gdlnQbzg7e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-FPwwd6a20oL0khxlV17lQP1fgSh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-CLHQd8Vyjoq587xOQKBlr5EDg4b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-VvZ8dKQ1BotXzxxPgaUlmeuQgCh\">Khi c&aacute;c nh&agrave; t&agrave;i trợ được lựa chọn cẩn thận để tr&aacute;nh những hậu quả ti&ecirc;u cực tiềm ẩn (<strong>potential negative consequences</strong>), việc t&agrave;i trợ c&oacute; thể mang lại lợi &iacute;ch đ&aacute;ng kể (<strong>subtantial benefits</strong>) cho nhiều b&ecirc;n li&ecirc;n quan (<strong>related parties</strong>).</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Supporting idea 1:</span></strong>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OOMmd2z40oU1GpxeAiOljjORg6c\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-IP8udCf4UodaQ1xp6r1lvwiTgHc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-FWGcdCLrAodR0zx9hxultvvcg0c\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-JcusdZSFzovztExclQWl7chLg4e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q9rFdK1ipoSiH8x8Lc1lqPoUgYf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AZa1dU6WtoYm51x9m3JlC8V6gQe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-G35adIotboSlwYxl0TulS1RkgJh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-CJ6GdGRwXoudFAxIHTnlNCa9gPg\">C&aacute;c c&ocirc;ng ty lớn c&oacute; thể hỗ trợ t&agrave;i ch&iacute;nh (<strong>financially support</strong>) cho c&aacute;c nh&agrave; tổ chức sự kiện (<strong>event organizers</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-CJ6GdGRwXoudFAxIHTnlNCa9gPg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>➜ gi&uacute;p tổ chức c&aacute;c giải đấu (<strong>tournaments</strong>) v&agrave; c&aacute;c m&agrave;n tr&igrave;nh diễn kh&aacute;c</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-CJ6GdGRwXoudFAxIHTnlNCa9gPg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>➜ nếu kh&ocirc;ng c&oacute; sự hỗ trợ n&agrave;y sẽ rất kh&oacute; khăn để một quốc gia hoặc đội chủ nh&agrave; (<strong>host</strong> <strong>country or team</strong>) chi trả cho việc x&acirc;y dựng cơ sở vật chất (<strong>facilities</strong>) hoặc cung cấp dịch vụ (<strong>hospitality</strong>)&nbsp;cho c&aacute;c đội tham dự.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Supporting idea 2:</span></strong>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VZnEdzqc4oEV4wxO5mZluCDFgQd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BXimdSddLo8wilxpbXMli5xmgBf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CXfQd5foZotNYvxR3yulUfOegnb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JKs3d2HFfoJfLcxOlhZlsYPPgOc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OVGzda09ioegiAxjp4BlwN6Ugee\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Dc96dxi8Do6jiRxbpzIlbykXgw1\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-SmqNdAdGQozDyNxx9Ufl3QlCgZg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-FSF9dWag4o1hqexMvMilCnbPgIf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">C&aacute;c vận động vi&ecirc;n đoạt huy chương (<strong>medalists</strong>)&nbsp;v&agrave; c&aacute;c vận động vi&ecirc;n nổi tiếng thường được trao thưởng cao hơn (<strong>higher monetary rewards</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-FSF9dWag4o1hqexMvMilCnbPgIf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>➜ khuyến kh&iacute;ch c&aacute;c vận động vi&ecirc;n luyện tập chăm chỉ hơn (<strong>more diligently</strong>), vượt qua giới hạn bản th&acirc;n (<strong>push their boundaries</strong>)<strong> </strong>v&agrave; giao lưu nhiều hơn với kh&aacute;n giả (<strong>engage with audiences</strong>)</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-FSF9dWag4o1hqexMvMilCnbPgIf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>➜ thu h&uacute;t nhiều người h&acirc;m mộ hơn một sự kiện chỉ to&agrave;n quảng c&aacute;o kh&ocirc;ng li&ecirc;n quan</div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-FSF9dWag4o1hqexMvMilCnbPgIf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span>➜ g&oacute;p phần tạo n&ecirc;n h&igrave;nh ảnh t&iacute;ch cực cho m&ocirc;n thể thao đ&oacute; trong mắt c&ocirc;ng ch&uacute;ng (<strong>public opinion</strong>).</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 105,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction ",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MMqsdb1rroHJIYxY7HflnQTPg4c\">Some people think the practice of big companies sponsoring sports events to promote their products brings about several problems. <strong>While this opinion is reasonable in the event of controversial products being marketed, I believe that, in other scenarios, corporate sponsors can actually offer various benefits.</strong></div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 12907,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 106,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QAjMdn8dCozI3TxVZFIlaLJ2gqd\"><strong>While advocating active lifestyles and entertaining are purportedly some of the main purposes of sports competitions, these goals are often undermined by irrelevant advertisements, especially for unhealthy products.</strong> <span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\">For example, if sugary or alcoholic drinks are heavily advertised throughout a sports championship, this might convey the wrong message to the audience, giving them the sense that those products are positively associated with health and fitness</span>.<span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"> It is even more misleading when performers are forced to use or consume those products during an event, which, in my estimation, probably leads to their loyal fans doing the same. People, consequently, could lose interest and faith in both sports and their players, if this harmful practice continues unabated, contributing to a decline in popularity for sports with questionable advertising choices.</span></div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 12907,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 107,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 2 ",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TKdOdZgwpoPyZMxCS0tlJF9qgEd\"><strong>In contrast, when sponsors are carefully chosen to avoid those potential negative consequences, it can bring about substantial benefits to many related parties. </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(45, 194, 107);\">One of the most obvious is that large firms can financially support event organizers in hosting tournaments and other exciting performances. Without those sizeable contracts, it would be very challenging for a host country or team to cover all the relevant costs, such as the construction of facilities or providing hospitality to participants.<span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"> </span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\">In addition, with financial backing from sponsors, medalists and popular players are usually offered higher monetary rewards. This encourages athletes to practice more diligently, push their boundaries, and engage with audiences at competitions and games. An exciting, energetic event obviously attracts more fans than one filled with irrelevant ads, and thus contributes positively to the public opinion of that sport.</span></div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 12907,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 108,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Conclusion ",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"KDygdzHXmoLYnqxeNBSlhbHrg4c\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O0xadyNQVoLYRpxwfaPl85Segud\">In conclusion, core sports values are undermined when sporting events are taken advantage of as a marketing tool for potentially harmful products, but when hosts and athletes deliberately choose more appropriate sponsors, this is greatly beneficial to the world of sports.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 12907,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
        ],
